WEBVTT

00:07.700 --> 00:12.610
If I can protect the town 
in your place, then I will.

00:13.510 --> 00:19.360
<i>Encouraged by my friends, 
I decided to save both Manicia and the town.</i>

00:20.160 --> 00:25.170
<i>I will conquer the labyrinth in order 
to make all of my dreams come true.</i>

00:26.230 --> 00:29.170
<i>I immediately set to work forming a clan,</i>

00:29.170 --> 00:32.420
<i>but I was summoned by adventurers 
exploring Avancia's labyrinth.</i>

00:33.840 --> 00:38.300
<i>I didn't think members of my old party
would be exploring the labyrinth.</i>

00:43.930 --> 00:46.730
Okay, allow us to reintroduce ourselves.

00:48.010 --> 00:52.060
I am Lilia. I haven't seen you 
since the day you were kicked out, Rud.

00:52.600 --> 00:54.530
I'm her twin sister, Lily.

00:55.050 --> 00:58.700
We're twins, but we have different 
eye colors due to a physical idiosyncrasy.

00:59.170 --> 01:00.500
<i>They're so close.</i>

01:01.370 --> 01:04.110
That must've been difficult for you.

01:04.110 --> 01:07.330
I am the church knight, Sugol.

01:07.690 --> 01:10.800
I-I'm Luna. It's nice to meet you.

01:14.500 --> 01:16.550
Let's discuss the details inside.

01:18.590 --> 01:19.410
Hey.

01:20.720 --> 01:23.220
It's been a while, Rud.

01:23.660 --> 01:24.430
Kyglas!

01:25.010 --> 01:29.300
You've got some nerve asking Rud 
to meet you after what you did to him.

01:31.420 --> 01:34.330
Thanks, but I'm fine now.

01:35.240 --> 01:36.060
Kyglas.

01:36.930 --> 01:38.370
Explain yourself.

01:39.000 --> 01:41.720
You didn't invite me here 
just to say hello, did you?

01:44.570 --> 01:49.630
Yesterday, we encountered 
a sentient guardian.

01:49.880 --> 01:51.840
<i>A sentient guardian?</i>

01:53.170 --> 01:58.030
<i>We've never been able to converse with
guardians that we've fought before now,</i>

01:58.030 --> 02:00.430
<i>even when they were humanoid.</i>

02:03.370 --> 02:06.380
You can see how that turned out for me, so...

02:07.350 --> 02:09.760
You should explore the labyrinth instead.

02:09.760 --> 02:10.380
What?

02:11.120 --> 02:13.780
While I'm stuck here, 
you should finish the mission!

02:13.780 --> 02:15.680
Quit complaining and hop to it!

02:15.680 --> 02:21.410
In other words, having you pick up where 
he left off is his way of apologizing.

02:21.410 --> 02:22.570
Don't tell him <i>that!</i>

02:22.570 --> 02:24.080
Hm? Are you embarrassed?

02:24.080 --> 02:24.870
No way!

02:25.430 --> 02:26.580
Aw, man.

02:27.540 --> 02:32.000
You need the Secret Treasure of the 
Labyrinth to cure your sister, right?

02:32.000 --> 02:33.540
You remember that?

02:35.920 --> 02:43.170
I understand now what 
was enabling me to fight.

02:44.590 --> 02:46.470
So what are you gonna do?

02:46.990 --> 02:49.640
Are you going or not?

02:51.040 --> 02:52.350
Let me do it.

02:59.940 --> 03:02.700
I'm going to borrow Lilia and the others.

03:03.130 --> 03:03.880
Rud.

03:05.870 --> 03:07.620
I'm sorry for everything.

03:09.620 --> 03:11.780
Don't get yourself killed.

03:13.520 --> 03:14.560
Thanks.

03:15.840 --> 03:18.140
I promise I'll defeat that guardian.

03:30.020 --> 03:39.860
<b>The Strongest Tank's Labyrinth Raids</b>

03:30.020 --> 03:39.860
<b>Labyrinth Raids</b>

03:30.020 --> 03:39.860
m 124 277 l 134 267 140 274 144 272 150 275 163 260 177 271 472 271 488 261 502 275 507 270 510 274 518 267 528 277 516 288 526 298 517 306 510 299 506 304 500 299 489 312 473 302 178 302 163 313 150 300 146 303 140 299 134 306 125 297 134 287

03:30.020 --> 03:39.860
A Tank with a Rare 9,999 Resistance Skill 
Got Kicked from the Hero's Party

04:51.400 --> 04:56.270
I can't believe Kyglas apologized.
Anyway, we've got a full party now.

04:56.270 --> 04:56.980
Yeah.

04:57.790 --> 05:00.160
Let's begin our raid of Avancia's labyrinth.

05:14.210 --> 05:15.380
What is this?

05:15.380 --> 05:18.250
It teleports us to the first floor.

05:18.690 --> 05:20.860
Okay, here we go.

05:31.310 --> 05:35.140
I can't believe this huge area
 was inside that entrance.

05:36.180 --> 05:37.910
There's even a sun.

05:37.910 --> 05:40.200
That sun doesn't move.

05:40.200 --> 05:42.540
So don't let it throw off your sense of time.

05:42.540 --> 05:43.820
Wow.

05:43.820 --> 05:46.110
The space inside a labyrinth is warped.

05:46.110 --> 05:49.280
Things that are impossible outside 
happen in here like they're nothing.

05:51.100 --> 05:53.040
The magic circle disappeared.

05:53.740 --> 05:55.830
So we can't use it to get back out?

05:55.830 --> 06:00.960
Right. In order to exit this place, 
we have to find another magic circle.

06:01.040 --> 06:06.510
<b>Teach Me!</b>

06:01.040 --> 06:06.510
<b>Ms. Nin</b>

06:01.260 --> 06:02.830
Don't worry, though.

06:02.830 --> 06:06.280
Lily has a skill called "Dungeon Walk."

06:06.800 --> 06:13.980
Normally, you need to find randomly placed 
magic circles to travel between floors,

06:13.220 --> 06:26.440
<b>Dungeon</b>

06:13.220 --> 06:26.440
<b>Walk</b>

06:13.980 --> 06:18.510
but with Dungeon Walk, you can travel 
to and from floors you've already visited.

06:18.510 --> 06:19.740
I see.

06:19.740 --> 06:23.840
Generally, up to six people can 
benefit from the effects of a skill,

06:23.840 --> 06:26.440
so only six people can 
be teleported in this way.

06:27.000 --> 06:29.420
There's another spell 
similar to Dungeon Walk.

06:29.420 --> 06:31.320
Nin, show her.

06:31.580 --> 06:32.490
Got it.

06:35.130 --> 06:37.320
It's an emergency escape spell.

06:37.320 --> 06:38.340
Let me try.

06:38.340 --> 06:38.830
What?

06:42.370 --> 06:44.320
I can't believe you learned it so quickly.

06:44.320 --> 06:45.410
Wow.

06:45.410 --> 06:46.380
Yeah.

06:47.760 --> 06:52.050
<i>That was probably 
a combat homunculus ability.</i>

06:53.790 --> 06:56.810
There are three chameleon 
kongs heading this way.

07:00.400 --> 07:01.980
Lilia and Sugol, you're at the front.

07:02.630 --> 07:05.570
Nin and Lily, you're at the back.
 You're on support and healing.

07:06.070 --> 07:08.780
Luna, position yourself 
where you can protect everyone.

07:09.450 --> 07:12.410
As usual, I'll be the group's shield.

07:13.990 --> 07:15.310
Provoke.

07:37.240 --> 07:39.020
Keep it up! We'll take them down!

07:39.020 --> 07:39.850
Got it.

07:42.410 --> 07:43.810
Oh?

07:44.390 --> 07:46.380
Not bad.

07:53.980 --> 07:57.120
This is where we met the guardian last time.

07:57.530 --> 07:58.860
He's not here.

08:00.620 --> 08:01.910
Fieldasaurus.

08:03.180 --> 08:07.710
<i>They're faster than the usual ones you get 
in labyrinths. Is it the guardian's doing?</i>

08:09.520 --> 08:11.260
I'll handle these two.

08:12.360 --> 08:14.340
You guys find the magic circle.

08:14.340 --> 08:15.390
Got it.

08:15.660 --> 08:16.950
Provoke.

08:22.600 --> 08:25.100
Let's save some strength 
to fight the guardian.

08:29.510 --> 08:31.110
I found the magic circle.

08:31.490 --> 08:33.360
Okay. Let's hurry on ahead!

08:34.620 --> 08:36.780
A wise decision.

08:39.440 --> 08:40.970
Seventh floor.

08:41.930 --> 08:43.580
Eighth floor.

08:44.480 --> 08:46.210
Ninth floor.

08:47.120 --> 08:50.300
Come to me soon.

08:53.120 --> 08:55.800
The next floor is the tenth at last.

08:58.980 --> 08:59.770
You guys.

09:01.080 --> 09:05.040
Thank you for accommodating
 my selfish goals.

09:05.450 --> 09:06.730
Where did <i>that</i> come from?

09:07.580 --> 09:09.450
Don't worry about it.

09:10.480 --> 09:12.530
It's for your sister, right?

09:12.530 --> 09:15.130
We understand how important family is.

09:15.130 --> 09:16.410
Yeah.

09:16.410 --> 09:17.740
That's right.

09:18.160 --> 09:20.610
And you shouldn't be thanking us just yet.

09:23.570 --> 09:24.480
Rud.

09:28.420 --> 09:30.250
The true test is still to come.

09:33.530 --> 09:34.350
I know.

09:43.290 --> 09:45.280
Let's defeat the guardian together.

09:50.180 --> 09:52.360
It's a grassy field.

09:54.800 --> 09:58.490
You have fought impressively.

09:58.740 --> 09:59.900
<i>So this is the guy.</i>

10:00.620 --> 10:05.290
I never expected such 
powerful adventurers to come here.

10:05.560 --> 10:07.750
<i>The sentient guardian.</i>

10:08.180 --> 10:11.660
Welcome to my labyrinth.

10:14.550 --> 10:17.730
I am this labyrinth's guardian...

10:19.740 --> 10:21.070
Marius.

10:26.330 --> 10:29.560
I heard the guardian was 
previously found on the fifth floor.

10:29.840 --> 10:32.820
Given how strong you are,

10:32.820 --> 10:36.650
I thought I'd wait on the tenth floor 
so I wouldn't have to hold back.

10:38.570 --> 10:41.790
This floor is my domain.

10:41.790 --> 10:46.660
Well, you'll see soon enough 
what my full strength looks like.

10:51.930 --> 10:55.210
How's he so strong? It feels like 
my arms are about to be torn off.

10:55.210 --> 10:57.980
I'm impressed you blocked that.

10:57.980 --> 10:59.420
You were worth the wait.

10:59.990 --> 11:00.930
Marius.

11:00.930 --> 11:04.090
I didn't come here to fight. We can talk—

11:04.090 --> 11:07.180
A clash of blades.

11:07.490 --> 11:11.310
That is how men converse with one another.

11:12.810 --> 11:14.770
<i>If I let my guard down, he'll kill me.</i>

11:15.200 --> 11:16.730
We'll negotiate afterwards.

11:17.030 --> 11:18.000
Let's fight.

11:18.690 --> 11:19.570
Here we go.

11:20.280 --> 11:22.330
<i>Oh? Not bad.</i>

11:31.100 --> 11:34.320
What's this guy's deal? 
Does he have eyes on his back?

11:34.320 --> 11:36.500
Your coordination is impressive.

11:36.730 --> 11:39.990
It seems I'll have to fight 
at full strength after all.

11:40.530 --> 11:44.140
And when I do, I become a true monster.

11:44.140 --> 11:48.000
If you don't want to die, 
you should use your skills to flee.

11:48.000 --> 11:51.520
Do you really think you can defeat me?

12:00.290 --> 12:01.750
What the heck is this guy?

12:02.160 --> 12:05.570
<i>I can tell from his roar alone
just how dangerous he is.</i>

12:06.050 --> 12:06.910
<i>But...</i>

12:07.780 --> 12:09.860
<i>I can't turn back.</i>

12:12.090 --> 12:13.210
<i>I have to win.</i>

12:15.040 --> 12:17.000
His attacks are so powerful.

12:22.390 --> 12:24.810
SIster, ride my wind.

12:24.810 --> 12:25.740
Got it.

12:30.720 --> 12:33.810
Mr. Rud, let's take turns 
drawing the enemy's attention.

12:33.810 --> 12:34.560
Agreed.

12:34.790 --> 12:36.440
Magic: Provoke.

12:41.610 --> 12:44.700
<i>I knew he was unusually strong.</i>

12:46.180 --> 12:49.670
<i>But one more hit could kill me.</i>

12:50.760 --> 12:52.490
Don't let him hit you head-on.

12:52.490 --> 12:55.420
You're the only one who'd even try that.

12:56.830 --> 12:58.540
Nin, focus on healing.

12:59.460 --> 13:02.080
Lily, use support spells 
to keep our front line up.

13:02.080 --> 13:03.280
Luna, assist us.

13:03.280 --> 13:04.800
Understood.

13:05.050 --> 13:06.840
Sugol, let's switch.

13:07.150 --> 13:08.400
Provoke.

13:11.760 --> 13:14.020
We won't be able to avoid a long fight.

13:14.870 --> 13:18.310
It'll be a battle of endurance. 
Will we be all right?

13:18.640 --> 13:23.400
Normally, we'd be at a 
disadvantage, but we have Rud.

13:23.760 --> 13:27.600
Rud's Shield of Sacrifice 
focuses all of our damage onto him.

13:28.020 --> 13:30.200
Life Exchange will turn the absorb shield

13:30.200 --> 13:33.790
he loses over a long fight
 into incredible strength.

13:34.780 --> 13:39.080
We have to stay alive during the long battle 
and put all our trust into his one attack.

13:47.430 --> 13:48.220
Ms. Lilia!

13:48.870 --> 13:52.160
At this rate, someone will fall eventually.

13:52.160 --> 13:52.850
Luna.

13:53.470 --> 13:57.350
I know it's hard being in the
 back and having to watch.

13:57.350 --> 14:01.230
But as long as we stay standing, 
the front line will be fine.

14:01.230 --> 14:02.860
So remember this.

14:03.890 --> 14:07.610
It's up to us to be patient and endure this.

14:11.430 --> 14:12.740
Got it.

14:17.920 --> 14:19.560
<i>His movements are slowing.</i>

14:19.560 --> 14:21.070
<i>Is he getting tired?</i>

14:23.250 --> 14:25.460
<i>My absorb shield has been depleted by 30,000.</i>

14:26.940 --> 14:28.760
<i>If I hit him with this...</i>

14:31.720 --> 14:32.470
Master.

14:34.040 --> 14:35.220
Luna.

14:35.220 --> 14:37.180
<i>I won't miss this opportunity.</i>

14:37.180 --> 14:38.730
<i>I'll hit him with this attack.</i>

14:38.730 --> 14:40.690
Life Conversion!

14:48.220 --> 14:49.580
Did we win?

14:53.300 --> 14:55.700
You're kidding, right? He can still move?

14:58.430 --> 15:00.510
<i>My attack was effective.</i>

15:00.510 --> 15:03.170
<i>If I hit him with another Life Conversion...</i>

15:22.710 --> 15:24.110
Are you guys okay?

15:24.410 --> 15:25.470
We're fine.

15:26.260 --> 15:27.070
Lily!

15:28.710 --> 15:29.670
Are you okay?

15:30.110 --> 15:32.780
I'll recover from this right away.

15:38.780 --> 15:39.890
Sugol!

15:40.800 --> 15:42.550
I-I'm fine.

15:43.960 --> 15:46.590
I can... keep fighting.

15:53.300 --> 15:57.060
<i>Am I willing to expose the others
 to danger for my goals?</i>

15:59.200 --> 16:05.420
<i>I don't want to risk their lives for my sake.</i>

16:07.840 --> 16:09.280
Retreat.

16:09.690 --> 16:11.110
Prepare to leave.

16:11.110 --> 16:12.240
What are you—

16:12.510 --> 16:14.610
I'm the leader of this party.

16:14.610 --> 16:17.200
I have to make the right choice.

16:19.890 --> 16:21.000
Rud!

16:21.300 --> 16:24.210
You're giving up on your dream 
after making it this far?

16:24.790 --> 16:25.670
Nin?

16:25.950 --> 16:29.000
I told you to do wha you wanted to do.

16:29.260 --> 16:31.590
Mr. Rud, please don't underestimate me.

16:32.190 --> 16:34.880
You gave the order to retreat 
after looking at me, right?

16:35.400 --> 16:39.850
I'm still here. 
I'm prepared to fight to the death.

16:40.270 --> 16:41.060
Rud.

16:41.820 --> 16:43.250
We can't run.

16:43.770 --> 16:47.480
Don't say something so pathetic!

16:50.810 --> 16:51.720
I...

16:56.580 --> 17:00.160
I want to save Manicia, so...

17:00.160 --> 17:01.370
Please.

17:01.370 --> 17:03.500
Skill: Fusion.

17:11.000 --> 17:13.820
Fusion complete: Lilialy.

17:15.040 --> 17:15.880
Lilialy.

17:16.260 --> 17:17.680
Let me handle this.

17:22.470 --> 17:23.770
<i>Lilialy.</i>

17:24.880 --> 17:26.230
<i>Sugol.</i>

17:27.520 --> 17:29.440
<i>Luna. Nin.</i>

17:30.000 --> 17:31.240
<i>This time...</i>

17:32.650 --> 17:34.780
Sugol's absorb shield has been broken!

17:35.100 --> 17:37.280
Life Conversion!

17:43.040 --> 17:47.460
<i>If that attack hits me, 
my shield will break.</i>

17:48.010 --> 17:49.540
<i>But I'll take it.</i>

17:50.000 --> 17:53.760
<i>I'll turn this last damage 
I take into strength.</i>

17:54.000 --> 17:55.840
Go!

17:57.800 --> 18:01.500
Life Conversion!

18:24.200 --> 18:26.250
That was fun, Rud.

18:27.670 --> 18:30.770
I doubt I can move anymore.

18:30.770 --> 18:32.380
You're free to do as you wish.

18:33.560 --> 18:34.210
What?

18:34.640 --> 18:36.160
It's over?

18:36.160 --> 18:37.660
I suppose so, yes.

18:38.960 --> 18:42.640
But it won't truly be over 
until you finish me off.

18:43.160 --> 18:46.870
I told you, I came here to talk.

18:47.750 --> 18:48.560
Marius.

18:49.870 --> 18:54.360
Do you have the Secret Treasure of the 
Labyrinth that is said to grant any wish?

18:54.970 --> 18:57.280
Is this what you want?

18:57.280 --> 18:57.830
Here.

18:58.890 --> 19:01.280
That magic stone is capable of miracles.

19:01.280 --> 19:04.920
Infuse it with mana and make your wish.

19:04.920 --> 19:08.750
Once used, it will shatter, so use it well.

19:09.420 --> 19:12.190
That's all you wanted, right? Now finish me.

19:12.650 --> 19:17.840
Actually, I'd like to avoid destroying the 
labyrinth if I can. There's a town nearby.

19:17.840 --> 19:18.950
So...

19:20.470 --> 19:26.180
Marius, I'd like you to continue 
ruling this labyrinth as its guardian.

19:29.050 --> 19:32.060
In other words, you want to work together?

19:32.540 --> 19:35.690
I like fighting strong opponents.

19:35.690 --> 19:39.310
So I'd be glad to help out.

19:39.310 --> 19:41.920
Plus, I'd like a rematch against you someday.

19:41.920 --> 19:43.160
Uh...

19:43.160 --> 19:46.190
Actually, I'd rather we didn't.

19:52.300 --> 19:54.830
Brother, you're a mess.

19:55.300 --> 19:58.670
I'm fine. More importantly, take this.

19:59.290 --> 20:00.420
It's for you.

20:01.290 --> 20:02.390
What is this?

20:02.880 --> 20:04.890
It's the magic stone I've been searching for.

20:05.850 --> 20:07.380
I can't accept this.

20:07.380 --> 20:09.980
You should use it for yourself.

20:10.680 --> 20:13.440
Even then, I'd use it for the same thing.

20:16.190 --> 20:18.300
So take it, okay?

20:22.000 --> 20:23.150
Brother...

20:25.760 --> 20:27.020
Very well.

20:29.850 --> 20:32.140
Magic stone of miracles.

20:34.240 --> 20:38.490
Please grant me my greatest wish.

20:45.200 --> 20:46.840
Notice any changes?

20:48.120 --> 20:49.470
Manicia?

20:49.470 --> 20:52.310
I feel like I have a bit more energy.

20:52.950 --> 20:56.940
Before, I'd quickly grow short of breath
 if I moved around like this.

20:58.490 --> 21:02.320
But now, I feel like I could spin forever.

21:06.610 --> 21:09.320
<i>I've never seen Manicia like this before.</i>

21:10.000 --> 21:14.960
<i>If I keep adventuring, I'll surely be able
 to cure her completely someday.</i>

21:15.570 --> 21:16.710
Brother.

21:17.720 --> 21:21.500
<i>I thought she might die someday, but now...</i>

21:23.300 --> 21:25.410
<i>She's fine.</i>

21:26.070 --> 21:30.130
<i>Everything I've done up until now
 hasn't been in vain.</i>

21:33.480 --> 21:36.400
Brother, thank you.

23:11.380 --> 23:12.450
Rud.

23:12.960 --> 23:15.410
Marius? What is it?

23:15.620 --> 23:16.990
Congratulations.

23:17.510 --> 23:20.610
As of today, you're the 
guardian of the labyrinth.

23:21.420 --> 23:22.320
Come again?
